// Document A document of a resource. `type` is `page`, `board`, `map`, `time` or `blank`. A new
// resource's first document is `blank`. The first write of page blocks, board records, map features
// or timeline lanes to a `blank` document converts it to a `page`, `board`, `map` or `time`
// document and keeps its name, as picking a type for a blank document in the app does; a write that
// is refused or changes nothing leaves it `blank`, and reads never convert it. Once converted, the
// document answers 400 KIND_MISMATCH to writes of another type. A map document carries `mapImage`
// in the responses of getDocument, createDocument and updateDocument: its image and coordinate
